# Allow-list: the API image gets the application and nothing else. A deny-list
# let everything new into the image by default: CI configuration, the staging and
# telemetry set-up, and on a developer machine staging/.vagrant with the VM's
# private key (Trivy's secret scan found it in a locally built image).
*
!app.py
!config.py
!requirements.txt
!api_views/
!models/
!database/
!openapi_specs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
database/*.db
